# Lesson 2 (Mind the Steel): the first throw strikes a preplaced blade
# (`node tools/plan.mjs tut-spacing --miss 1`): the miss shows in the HUD,
# U undoes it, H shows the hint line, P pauses (the pause panel), Resume,
# Escape pauses again and Leave round goes back to the title. Then a
# practice round: R restarts it into a new countdown.
until 300 Play
frames 5
click Learn to Play
until 60 Lesson 2 — Mind the Steel
frames 5
click Lesson 2 — Mind the Steel
until 60 Begin
frames 5
click Begin
frames 543
key Space 2
frames 20
expect 1 / 3
save miss
key KeyU 2
frames 5
expect 0 / 3
key KeyH 2
frames 5
save hint
key KeyP 2
until 30 Paused
frames 5
save pause
click Resume
frames 20
key Escape 2
until 30 Leave round
frames 5
click Leave round
until 60 Play
frames 5
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 5
click Practice
until 60 Practice — Easy
frames 5
click Practice — Easy
until 60 Begin
frames 5
click Begin
frames 240
key KeyR 2
until 10 3
